## Acceptance Criteria
- Edit file: src/models/schema.py — implement the following enums as Python str enums: DocumentType (INVOICE, CREDIT_NOTE, DEBIT_NOTE, ACCRUAL), CategoryMethod (DETERMINISTIC_GL, DETERMINISTIC_SUPPLIER, KEYWORD, EMBEDDING, LLM, MANUAL), SpendType (DIRECT, INDIRECT, CAPEX, OPEX), Addressability (ADDRESSABLE, NON_ADDRESSABLE, EXCLUDED), ManagedStatus (MANAGED, UNMANAGED, PARTIALLY_MANAGED), ReviewStatus (PENDING, APPROVED, REJECTED, SKIPPED)
